eas such as Engineering, Mathematics, Statistics, etc. may be accepted.\nAll candidates must have before being accepted a letter from a teacher in the program agreeing in supervising the PhD. The program coordinator can help students in finding a potential advisor that best fits their interest.\nAccepted students must be able to read technical documents and attend seminars and conferences in English. Candidates must proof having level B1 of English.\nOrganization\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/en/phd/organization\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/++theme++genweb6.theme/img/logo.png\nShare:\nOrganization\nOrganization\nAdmission\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/en/phd/admission\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/++theme++genweb6.theme/img/logo.png\nShare:\nAdmission\nAdmission\nEnrolment\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/en/phd/enrolment\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/++theme++genweb6.theme/img/logo.png\nShare:\nEnrolment\nEnrolment\nProgram structure and activities\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/en/phd/program-structure-and-activities\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/++theme++genweb6.theme/img/logo.png\nShare:\nProgram structure and activities\nProgram structure and activities\nAnnual Evaluation\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/en/phd/Annual%20Evaluation\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/++theme++genweb6.theme/img/logo.png\nShare:\nAnnual Evaluation\nEvaluation of supervised research periods\nPublic Defense of Research Plan\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/en/phd/Research%20Plan\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/++theme++genweb6.theme/img/logo.png\nShare:\nPublic Defense of Research Plan\nResearch Plan Public Defense\nThesis document and defence\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/en/phd/thesis-document-and-defence\nhttps://artificialintelligence.phd.upc.edu/++theme++genweb6.theme/img/logo.png\nShare:\nThesis document and defenc